WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.096
We are going to the doctor for a check-up. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:06.096 --> 00:00:11.448
We say our name at the desk, then we wait for our turn.

3
00:00:11.448 --> 00:00:16.368
The nurse asks us to step on the scale to measure us.

4
00:00:16.368 --> 00:00:24.120
A soft wrap on our arm checks our blood pressure. It squeezes, then stops.

5
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:31.176
The doctor listens to our chest with a stethoscope. It is a little cold.

6
00:00:31.176 --> 00:00:37.560
The doctor asks questions. One question at a time is okay.

7
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:43.248
We can say: please speak slowly, or: I need a break.

8
00:00:43.248 --> 00:00:49.224
All done. The check-up is finished, and we can leave.

9
00:00:49.224 --> 00:00:57.432
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

